{"seq":5,"slug":"quantified-self","title":"量化自我与个人仪表盘","stage":"DONE","category":"personal-systems","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/personal-systems/quantified-self","rating":{"composite":3.93,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.42,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 量化自我与个人仪表盘 简介\n\n量化自我是一种通过持续采集、分析个人生活数据来驱动自我认知与改进的实践方法论。从 2007 年由《连线》杂志编辑 Gary Wolf 和 Kevin Kelly 提出概念至今，这一运动已从极客亚文化发展为主流消费行为——全球超过十亿人每天通过可穿戴设备被动采集心率、步数、睡眠和血氧数据。2026 年的核心变化在于：AI 将量化自我从「数据积累」推向「智能编排」，个人仪表盘不再是静态报表，而是跨领域协调健康、效率和财务的生活操作系统。\n\n本知识体系面向希望用数据思维管理自身健康与效能的技术从业者、产品经理和终身学习者。你不需要成为生物黑客，但需要理解如何选择正确的数据源、设计有意义的指标体系、构建可持续的追踪习惯，以及避免「优化成瘾」带来的反效果。\n\n全书共分四章：\n\n第一章**数据采集**系统梳理个人数据的类型分类、采集策略与技术实现，帮助读者建立从生物信号到行为日志的完整数据管道。\n\n第二章**健康追踪**深入睡眠、运动和心理健康三大核心领域，讲解如何从原始数据中提取有临床意义的健康洞察。\n\n第三章**个人仪表盘**聚焦可视化系统的设计与实现，从信息架构原则到具体技术栈选型，指导读者构建属于自己的生活数据中心。\n\n第四章**改进反馈闭环**将数据转化为行动，介绍如何设计个人实验、验证干预效果，并建立可持续的数据驱动改进循环。\n\n建议学习路径：先通读第一章理解数据全景，再根据自身最关注的领域（健康或效率）选读第二或第三章，最后通过第四章将所有知识串联为闭环实践。避免一开始就追求全量追踪——从一个核心指标起步，逐步扩展，才是可持续的量化之道。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-collection","title":"数据采集","docCount":3,"url":"/h/personal-systems/quantified-self/data-collection","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"life-data-types-and-collection-strategy","title":"生活数据类型与采集策略","url":"/h/personal-systems/quantified-self/data-collection/life-data-types-and-collection-strategy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"wearable-device-data-integration","title":"可穿戴设备数据集成","url":"/h/personal-systems/quantified-self/data-collection/wearable-device-data-integration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"passive-vs-active-tracking-balance","title":"被动与主动追踪的平衡","url":"/h/personal-systems/quantified-self/data-collection/passive-vs-active-tracking-balance"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"health-tracking","title":"健康追踪","docCount":3,"url":"/h/personal-systems/quantified-self/health-tracking","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sleep-data-analysis","title":"睡眠数据分析","url":"/h/personal-systems/quantified-self/health-tracking/sleep-data-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"exercise-and-heart-rate-data","title":"运动与心率数据","url":"/h/personal-systems/quantified-self/health-tracking/exercise-and-heart-rate-data"},{"seq":3,"slug":"stress-and-mental-health-metrics","title":"压力与心理健康指标","url":"/h/personal-systems/quantified-self/health-tracking/stress-and-mental-health-metrics"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"personal-dashboard","title":"个人仪表盘","docCount":3,"url":"/h/personal-systems/quantified-self/personal-dashboard","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dashboard-design-principles","title":"仪表盘设计原则","url":"/h/personal-systems/quantified-self/personal-dashboard/dashboard-design-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"technology-stack-selection","title":"技术栈选型","url":"/h/personal-systems/quantified-self/personal-dashboard/technology-stack-selection"},{"seq":3,"slug":"visualization-best-practices","title":"可视化最佳实践","url":"/h/personal-systems/quantified-self/personal-dashboard/visualization-best-practices"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"improvement-feedback-loop","title":"改进反馈闭环","docCount":3,"url":"/h/personal-systems/quantified-self/improvement-feedback-loop","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-driven-decision-framework","title":"数据驱动决策框架","url":"/h/personal-systems/quantified-self/improvement-feedback-loop/data-driven-decision-framework"},{"seq":2,"slug":"experiment-design-and-validation","title":"实验设计与验证","url":"/h/personal-systems/quantified-self/improvement-feedback-loop/experiment-design-and-validation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"long-term-trend-analysis","title":"长期趋势分析","url":"/h/personal-systems/quantified-self/improvement-feedback-loop/long-term-trend-analysis"}]}]}